    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nRun the program, find and fix the bug.\r\n* **\r\n**Use the _AI Tutor_ to help you DEBUG and fix the code.**\r\n\r\nYou can type things like:\r\n* _What does this error message mean?_\r\n* _Can you show me the correct way to write this line?_\r\n* _Why is my code not running?_\r\n* _Explain what's wrong and how to fix it in simple steps._\r\n",
